/*pentagon and kitchen tutorial*/<<set $pentagonDial to [1]>> <<set $pentagonLock to ['False']>> <<set $recipeNumber to [1,2,3].random()>> <<set $ITEMbanana to [0]>> <<set $ITEMcookie to [0]>> <<set $ITEManchovy to [0]>> <<set $ITEMplate to [0]>> <<set $tutorialCookingPot to []>><<set $tutorialIngredients to [0]>> <<set $tutorialSoupCooked to ['False']>> <<set $ITEMbananax2 to [0]>><<set $ITEMcookiex2 to [0]>><<set $ITEManchovyx2 to [0]>><<set $ITEMbanana_cookie to [0]>><<set $ITEMbanana_anchovy to [0]>><<set $ITEMcookie_anchovy to [0]>>

